# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
@keyframes fade-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  @at-root (without: all) {
    .fade-in {
      animation: fade-in 200ms ease;
    }
  }
  from {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

